# Keyed on org.springframework.boot.EnvironmentPostProcessor, which is the CURRENT interface in
# Boot 4.1. org.springframework.boot.env.EnvironmentPostProcessor still loads, through
# SpringFactoriesEnvironmentPostProcessorsFactory.loadDeprecatedPostProcessors, and is deprecated.
org.springframework.boot.EnvironmentPostProcessor=\
za.co.fnb.dcre.platform.batch.config.TelemetryEnvironmentPostProcessor
